## The first attempt failed, and that is the point of the hard gates
#
#   Thu Oct 22 16:47 UTC   attempt 1
#   selfhost/gen2.c:7826:29: error: 'flrun' undeclared (first use in this function)
#   selfhost/gen2.c:7831:33: error: 'flc' undeclared (first use in this function)
#   make: *** [Makefile:3804: true-selfhost-min] Error 1
#
# The new value scanner declared `hold flrun` / `hold flc` in three sibling
# `when` blocks. seed-min hoists a function's locals, so gen1_min.c compiled
# and every fixture passed in the dev loop; gen1_min scopes a `hold` to its
# block, so the second sibling emitted an assignment with no declaration and
# gen2.c would not compile. Fixed by giving each sibling block its own names
# (flruna/flca, flrunb/flcb/flcb2, flrunc/flcc, flrund/flcd) with a comment
# saying why. The run recorded above is the re-run after that fix.

